### Health check vehicle-analysis-service
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health

### Latest health report -> expected 200 (send a telemetry first)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/vehicles/VF1RFB00123456789/health-report

### All alerts of the latest report -> expected 200
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/vehicles/VF1RFB00123456789/alerts

### Critical alerts only -> expected 200
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/vehicles/VF1RFB00123456789/alerts?severity=CRITICAL

### Vehicle without report -> expected 404
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/vehicles/VF1AAA00000000001/health-report

### Invalid VIN -> expected 400
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/vehicles/INVALID-VIN/health-report

### Unknown severity -> expected 400
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/vehicles/VF1RFB00123456789/alerts?severity=UNKNOWN
